- Title: Pac-12 agrees to wide-ranging deal with Genius Sports
  URL: https://www.sportsbusinessjournal.com/Articles/2026/03/17/pac-12-agrees-to-wide-ranging-deal-with-genius-sports/
  Published_at: 2026-03-17
  Source: Sports Business Journal
  Article_content: Pac-12 has struck a deal with Genius Sports to deploy GeniusIQ, its data and AI platform, in every Pac-12 football and men's and women's basketball venue, enabling real-time analytics, enhanced data capture, and improved broadcast and fan engagement opportunities across the conference.

- Title: PlaySight, Microsoft create generative AI tool for pickleball
  URL: https://www.sportsbusinessjournal.com/Articles/2026/03/12/playsight-microsoft-create-generative-ai-analysis-tool-for-pickleball/
  Published_at: 2026-03-12
  Source: Sports Business Journal
  Article_content: PlaySight and Microsoft unveiled InSight AI, a generative AI analytics tool for pickleball designed to deliver advanced match analysis, coaching insights, and player performance suggestions in real time.

- Title: StubHub launches AI tool for rightsholders
